    <string name="onboarding_readiness_unavailable_desc">A required check failed, so this mode cannot be selected yet. Fix the items below and re-run, or choose another mode.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_shizuku_denied">Shizuku access was not granted. Start the Shizuku service and allow DFTB when prompted.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_module_dialog_title">Companion module</string>
    <string name="onboarding_module_dialog_text">The DFTB companion module is built on this device from the app itself and flashed through your root manager. Finish the setup first; the module installer is available afterwards from Settings. Until then, advanced root mode reports the module as missing.</string>
